OL,3,GNEWSAA40 bridge repair traffic concerns
OL,4,A'under review'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways has said it is
OL,7,Fconstantly looking for ways to ease
OL,8,Ftraffic on the A40 as repair work
OL,9,Fcontinues on the bridge at Over.
OL,11,FSouth West Engineering Lead for
OL,12,FNational Highways Terry Robinson said
OL,13,Fthe team was keeping the situation
OL,14,F"under constant review".
OL,16,FThe major route between Gloucester and
OL,17,Fthe Forest of Dean is undergoing a a
OL,18,Fnine-month repair job.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
