OL,3,GNEWSAA40 bridge repair traffic concerns
OL,4,A'under review'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has meant drivers have seen the dual
OL,7,Fcarriageway reduced to one lane both
OL,8,Fways, resulting in large queues and
OL,9,Fhours of delays.
